{
  "id": "ss.fx.dust",
  "name": "Dust kick",
  "description": "What the ground does when something leaves it or lands on it hard: a low smear of disturbed soil where the feet were, and a fan of motes thrown up and out of it, larger and darker low down, smaller and paler as they rise. Authored at the instant it leaves the ground; the game scales it up and fades it over the next third of a second. No outlines anywhere — dust has no edge, and a mote with ink round it is a pebble.",
